    "Id": "mechdef_anubis_ABS-3L",
    "Name": "Anubis ABS-3L",
    "Details": "Designed by Fredonian Industrial Technologies, the Anubis was originally designed to complement the Osiris BattleMech in use by the Federated Suns. The 'Mech's lightweight chassis carries a powerful Ceres Motors 250 XL engine that gives the Anubis a top speed of 129.6 km/h and is covered in a protective skin of Hellespont Lite Stealth Armor, making the Anubis extremely hard to hit at long range. The Anubis-3L is armed as an effective light fire support 'Mech. Its primary weapons are four LRM-5 launchers, allowing the 'Mech to provide long range fire support for other light 'Mechs. For close combat, the 3L has two Small Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "anubis"
  },
